  "title": "Implement tickets.release and tickets.status Tools",
  "description": "Implement two MCP tools: `tickets.release` to voluntarily release a claim before completion, and `tickets.status` to query the current state of a ticket or all tickets. `tickets.release` moves the ticket back to READY and clears the claim. `tickets.status` supports querying by ticket_id for detail or by filters (stage, type, priority) for listing.",
